item_name = "Fen Poultice"
description = "A damp compress of swamp-moss and crushed lichen, soaked in bog-wretch bile. Smear it on your weapon — or your hands, if you're that kind of fighter. Strikes deal 25% more damage for 15 seconds, but the fumes slow you by 10%. Consumable."
